+   - braak_nft_stage (B): 0-VI i.e. 0-6 (Braak & Braak, Acta Neuropathol 1991; Braak 2006).
+   - adnc_level: none/low/intermediate/high (the integrated ABC determination, Hyman/Montine 2012).
+
+  Bounds are the DEFINED ordinal/categorical ranges of consensus staging instruments, not derived numeric thresholds; a value outside the defined range is a coding or data-entry error. Domain anchor: Hyman BT et al. 2012 (NIA-AA neuropathologic assessment guidelines).
